schema: "0.4"
id: echo-of-manifestation-ui-main-menu
type: html
service: anthropic
quality: medium

prompt:
  system: "Generate a complete, self-contained HTML file with inline CSS. Modern, polished visual design. Dark fantasy aesthetic with amber accents on deep indigo-black backgrounds."
  text: >
    Create a dark fantasy game main menu screen for "Echo of Manifestation" — a survival
    horror roguelite. The page should be full-viewport with no scrolling.

    BACKGROUND: A large atmospheric image area showing the Twilight Zone boundary — the
    liminal space between worlds rendered as a vertical tear in reality, deep indigo void
    on one side dissolving into amber-tinged ruin on the other. Shadows that move wrong.
    This can be represented as a CSS gradient background with layered effects suggesting
    the boundary between worlds — deep indigo (#1a0a2e) transitioning to dark amber-brown
    (#2a1a0a) with subtle noise texture.

    TITLE: "ECHO OF MANIFESTATION" displayed prominently in the upper-center of the screen.
    The title should use a serif font with sharp angular serifs, rendered in amber (#D4A574)
    with a subtle dark shadow/glow effect. Below the title, a thin horizontal line with a
    small transmutation circle symbol at the center — a circle with a triangle inscribed
    within it.

    MENU OPTIONS: Centered below the title, vertical menu with the following options:
    - Continue (slightly brighter/more prominent, suggesting it's the primary action)
    - New Game
    - Options
    - Quit

    Each menu item should have hover effects: text transitions from off-white to amber,
    a faint amber line extends from the left side. The selected/hovered item should have
    a subtle glow. Menu text in a clean serif font, generous spacing between items.

    ALCHEMICAL BORDER: The entire viewport should have a border motif — faint alchemical
    symbols and geometric patterns running along the edges, suggesting a transmutation
    circle's outer ring. These should be subtle enough not to distract from the menu
    but visible enough to establish atmosphere. Use CSS borders or positioned pseudo-elements
    with simple geometric patterns.

    BOTTOM: Small text "A game about the cost of creation" as a tagline, centered, in
    muted amber, smaller font.

    Style: No rounded corners anywhere. Angular, crafted feel. Deep indigo-black (#0a0514)
    as the primary background. Amber (#D4A574) as the sole accent color. Off-white (#e8dcc8)
    for secondary text. The entire design should feel like opening a forbidden alchemical
    text — scholarly, dangerous, ancient.
  provider_options:
    text_format: html
    max_tokens: 4096

output:
  formats:
    - format: html

tags: [ui, mockup, main-menu, game-interface, dark-fantasy]
